Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 08 --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:32.88,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:32.88,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.08,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:57.07,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.23,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.42,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, if I sleep now, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:05.36,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.04,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.77,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking our break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.03,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:13.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:17.59,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You guys should get a breather too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:21.01,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,If you need me, just call my cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.26,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We'll finish right before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.30,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.96,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.64,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:11.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Your body's as cold as ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:17.83,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,If I turn the AC off, the guys will start sweating all over the manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.91,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,People's bodies turn cold from stress too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.48,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:36.33,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to talk to you about that new project you mentioned the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:42.52,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you should accept it if it'll drop the quality of your current work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:48.90,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you're not really physically or mentally strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:53.23,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you're making a good amount already, so there's no need to hound for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:54.54,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.63,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:05:00.81,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I may be doing well now, but who knows what'll happen next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:05.26,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,There'll always be newcomers sprouting up everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:11.87,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,My luck could change in the blink of an eye. {kinda liberal here, she lit says. "Just like that, they could turn their backs on me."}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:15.72,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, don't be so negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.74,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's not good for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.65,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You've got ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.01,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.86,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:30.57,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you're a girl. {implying they should look well-kept etc}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:36.92,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manga artist, not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:41.34,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:48.20,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Damn it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:55.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I really don't wanna go to work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said your name earlier. {'called your name' technically, but kids don't really say that imo}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:09.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's just so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:12.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to cool off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:18.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we make your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:19.52,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come and help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin's on summer vacation now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:48.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Every morning we make her lunch together\Nbefore she heads off to her summer daycare.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:52.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you say we visit Grandpa's grave this Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:55.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The Bon Festival's coming up, which is perfect for...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.14,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:03.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the bellflowers haven't bloomed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think it'll take a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:14.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For now, we'll go buy some at the florist,\Nand once ours blooms, we can just go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:23.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Although Grandpa would be happy if you brought your own flowers for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right? That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:31.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Still, if you visit his grave he'd be more than happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He'd be truly happy. {lol liberal}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:38.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:52.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If Rin weren't here, I doubt I'd be thinking of Grandpa like this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:55.95,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.34,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:01.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's all a mess if you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:08.75,Cit,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(903,423)}Citrus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:06.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why is your hair so thin anyway? {fine/thin/slender etc}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.83,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:19.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.05,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:29.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:32.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:36.41,Bon,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.6\pos(628,193)}Bon Festival Dance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:39.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About ten days I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.37,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.42,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:45.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Its shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This sure reminds me of when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:54.26,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a lot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't shake it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.89,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:09.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:15.89,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here lots of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,With Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:17.99,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:22.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh right, Grandma's buried here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:26.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:31.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You see, my mom is Grandpa and Grandma's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:34.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm their grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:37.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So your mom is Grandpa's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:43.89,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, then that makes me your mom's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:47.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Crap! I don't want to touch this subject!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:50.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.56,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:57.03,Grave2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\move(583,508,581,497,0,3443)}Kaga\N\N\N\NFamily\N\N\NGrave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:10:00.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The grave's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.89,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:15.13,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:17.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:27.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why'd she come here when she\Ndidn't even show up to the funeral?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.36,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stay right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pluck the weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:05.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why'd she visit a grave with some guy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Woof! Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:31.46,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.86,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were a stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just visiting the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I think you ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:45.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:48.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's at Grandpa's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:53.81,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:03.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, Rin's really important to me, so I don't think of you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what's going on in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:11.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Unless Rin wants to, I have no desire to let you two meet each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:14.46,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I already know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:18.97,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Did you follow me just to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:24.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to look at Rin from afar? {lit discreetly}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:30.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to clean up the grave,\Nlight some incense and then go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:33.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That all might take some time though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Rin's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And we'll do what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:01.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Rin. Was I gone long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:12.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:18.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? Sorry, I just had to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:21.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, was I gone long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:23.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Were you feeling lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:31.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're weird. Why are you so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:36.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:37.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:39.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put them over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.64,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a baby anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:58.55,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Blood really does pass on. {she lit says 'blood ties sure are strong'}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:01.02,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. She looks just like you, Ma-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.03,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,From back here, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:06.25,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:12.87,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From back here, it's like she's with Souichi-san again.{\i0} {i know the camera's focused on Rin here, but I think she's comparing Dai with his grandpa}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:23.06,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm glad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:27.59,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Whew, what a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:30.56,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe these types of coincidences happen around the Bon Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.99,MainLow,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,She's seven years old today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:36.53,MainLow,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.53,0:14:39.20,MainLow,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I was obviously surprised that you have a daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:41.73,MainLow,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,but I was scared that he might be an ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:43.24,MainLow,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:47.61,MainLow,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,He has zero common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:58.79,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Although I don't know what he'll be like in another fifty years. {implying he might mature into someone like the grandpa}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:02.33,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Fifty years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:09.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess it's safe to assume that guy is her boyfriend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:12.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm not saying it's wrong or anything...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:16.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:21.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But for someone like her, she sure found a boyfriend quickly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:22.71,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we visit Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.65,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it close by?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:34.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that's Grandpa's house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:36.40,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:40.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, no one's living there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:45.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But it's my mom's older brother's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:48.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The family altar is there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.17,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:59.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'll ask my uncle if we can go into the backyard at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:00.81,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:02.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just the backyard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.84,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:05.92,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:16.58,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to continue with the new project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.08,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:21.14,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure, Ma-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:24.90,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alone because of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.75,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I have to work more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:28.09,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You already are! {working enough}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You work more than almost anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:34.08,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.09,0:16:37.51,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I want to work so hard I can't\Nremember what I have for meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:41.68,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? I always forget what I eat. {TLC: you? isn't he talking about her?}{he says 'I'}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:43.34,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,If I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:46.64,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget all those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:47.93,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:57.45,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.63,Kaga,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.6\pos(743,467)}Kaga
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:17.17,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:22.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No, but you have.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.50,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So is the dirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:50.00,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa loved those bellflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think my uncle meant to remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:18:00.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He knew they were Grandpa's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:04.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But because he had to remove them when winter came,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:09.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,maybe he didn't know that they sprout again in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:18.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And these rocks are here to stop\Nweeds from growing all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:27.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We're lucky we moved Rin's fragrant olive in time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:36.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But, we still have Grandpa's bellflowers at home, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:53.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess change isn't always bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:57.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That will always be Grandpa's grave, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.00,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:09.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
