Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.59,Ck2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(647,207)}Happy Birthday,\NRin-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:18.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:25.59,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei, could you look over it one last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.15,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.94,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you took off more than you can chew this time. {or "Maybe you overdid it this time"}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:37.13,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I can't work when you say stuff like that, so please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:50.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:59.02,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I promise I'll finish this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:52.25,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the festival booths will close soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.25,0:21:54.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:58.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.59,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:10.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? Weren't we gonna meet you at the shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.89,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My mom's too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:14.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:17.04,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump like this if I wear one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:19.89,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't that awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:22.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.97,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'll meet us there once she gets her yukata on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:35.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! The booths are gonna close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.70,0:22:43.81,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Look out for cars, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.81,0:22:44.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:47.57,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me! It's hard to run in these shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.57,0:22:48.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll carry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.37,0:22:49.25,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.25,0:22:50.67,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna be carried!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.67,0:22:52.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:54.13,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
